Basic autoscale (K8s or VM group)\n\n---\n\n## Category C — **Large frontier OSS** (65B–72B)\nUse: premium endpoint, high quality answers.\n\n- **GPU VRAM needed (weights only)**\n  - FP16: 130–145 GB\n  - INT8: 65–72 GB\n  - INT4: 33–36 GB\n- **Real serving target**\n  - **2x80GB minimum** (tight)\n  - **4x80GB recommended** (good KV cache + concurrency)\n- **Good prod setup**\n  - CPU: 32–64 vCPU\n  - RAM: 256–512 GB\n  - NVMe: 2–4 TB\n  - Network: 50–100 Gbps\n- **Infra**\n  - tensor parallel runtime\n  - queue for burst traffic\n  - canary deploy + rollback\n  - strict quotas + per-tenant isolation\n\n---\n\n## Category D — **Very large / MoE frontier** (100B+ or MoE)\nUse: top quality, high traffic, enterprise SLA.\n\n- **GPU**\n  - 8x–32x H100/B200 class (multi-node)\n  - high-speed interconnect (RDMA/InfiniBand ideal)\n- **Host memory**\n  - RAM: 512 GB–2 TB per node\n  - NVMe: 4–8 TB per node\n  - Network: 100–400 Gbps fabric\n- **Infra**\n  - Kubernetes + GPU operator\n  - distributed serving + smart router\n  - multi-region failover\n  - full SRE stack (alerts, SLO, incident runbooks)\n\n---\n\n## Fast memory rule (important)\n- FP16/BF16 memory ≈ **2 bytes per parameter**\n- INT8 ≈ **1 byte per parameter**\n- INT4 ≈ **0.5 byte per parameter**\n- Then add extra **30–100%** for KV cache + batching + runtime overhead.\n\nSo:\n- 70B FP16 raw ~140GB, but prod often wants much more total VRAM headroom.\n\n---\n\n## Infra maturity by stage\n\n### MVP\n- single region\n- 1 model pool\n- vLLM + gateway + metrics\n\n### Production\n- 2 pools (standard/premium)\n- autoscaling\n- Redis + queue\n- SLO dashboards\n\n### Enterprise\n- multi-region\n- DR drills\n- audit/compliance\n- cost governance + per-customer quotas\n\n---\n\nIf you give me target traffic (req/min, avg in/out tokens, p95 latency), me give exact GPU count per category.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01f2ca87602628a00169f1e0cb678c8191a0f5e4f9b2b1c541\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":950,"output":1030,"cacheRead":12800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14780,"cost":{"input":0.0016625,"output":0.01442,"cacheRead":0.00224,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0183225}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777459399114,"responseId":"resp_01f2ca87602628a00169f1e0c7616c8191a4a43363835c711f"}}
